    "en": "When did you go to Paris?"
   },
   {
    "t": "¿Con quién fuiste?",
    "ko": "그녀는 왜 집에 있었어요?",
    "en": "Why did she stay at home?"
   },
   {
    "t": "No compré ningún recuerdo.",
    "ko": "그들은 박물관을 보지 않았어요.",
    "en": "They didn't see the museum."
   }
  ],
